// KORU213: `anytype` on a tor input field is a Zig parameter qualifier, not
// a type — spliced into the emitted Input struct it fails Zig's grammar and
// surfaced as KORU207 inside generated code. Generics stay comptime codegen
// (no parametric tor grammar, ruled 2026-06-13); the field names a concrete
// type or the declaration is refused at check time.

~tor peek { v: anytype }
~peek -> v
